 class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Create Photo Strips Online</h3><p>Learn how to create photo strips online, capture memories, and share them instantly with friends and family.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"guides\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-480.avif?v=5bef110a 480w, /assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-640.avif?v=cb653733 640w, /assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-960.avif?v=43482d3a 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-480.webp?v=74ddc5db 480w, /assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-640.webp?v=8952145b 640w, /assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-960.webp?v=c990c39d 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/best-virtual-photo-booth-for-friends-and-couples-960.webp?v=c990c39d\" alt=\"Best Virtual Photo Booth for Friends and Couples\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Best Virtual Photo Booth for Friends and Couples</h3><p>Discover why virtual photo booths are becoming a popular way for friends and couples to create memories together online.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"guides\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-480.avif?v=2673253b 480w, /assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-640.avif?v=4d0968f4 640w, /assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-960.avif?v=afe9f6f6 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-480.webp?v=52ac44e8 480w, /assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-640.webp?v=9ad569ab 640w, /assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-960.webp?v=fb7ac2a7 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/how-to-host-a-virtual-photo-booth-party-960.webp?v=fb7ac2a7\" alt=\"Illustration of a video call grid with photo strips being taken\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Host a Virtual Photo Booth Party</h3><p>A tested 90-minute running order, prompts that work, breakout advice for bigger groups, and the problems to expect.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"guides\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-480.avif?v=f4b7b430 480w, /assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-640.avif?v=521ebfdf 640w, /assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-960.avif?v=67cc52cc 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-480.webp?v=024dbbd5 480w, /assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-640.webp?v=7be4b839 640w, /assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-960.webp?v=e1c71cec 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/browser-photo-booth-vs-app-960.webp?v=e1c71cec\" alt=\"Illustration comparing a browser window and a phone app icon\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Browser Photo Booth vs App: An Honest Comparison</h3><p>Setup, sharing, privacy, offline use and longevity compared - including the cases where a native app is genuinely better.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"guides\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-480.avif?v=edff5860 480w, /assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-640.avif?v=2a1da262 640w, /assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-960.avif?v=37e45547 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-480.webp?v=505af017 480w, /assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-640.webp?v=4c8bbe8a 640w, /assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-960.webp?v=f97f35ea 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser-960.webp?v=f97f35ea\" alt=\"Illustration of a browser window with a camera permission prompt\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Camera Not Working in Your Browser? 6 Fixes</h3><p>Six causes, in the order that resolves the most cases fastest - starting with the one nobody suspects.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/how-to-share-photo-strips-on-instagram\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"guides\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/how-to-share-photo-strips-on-instagram-480.avif?v=d19f7380 480w, /assets/blog/how-to-share-photo-strips-on-instagram-640.avif?v=0d063e28 640w, /assets/blog/how-to-share-photo-strips-on-instagram-960.avif?v=738132